  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.530" end="00:04.420" ttm:agent="v1">種瓜得瓜 種豆得豆</p>
      <p begin="00:04.420" end="00:06.780" ttm:agent="v1">這不是因果嗎?</p>
      <p begin="00:06.780" end="00:09.880" ttm:agent="v1">因果是科學</p>
      <p begin="00:09.880" end="00:11.700" ttm:agent="v1">絕對是存在的</p>
      <p begin="00:11.700" end="00:13.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yep, what up, Jack?)</p>
      <p begin="00:13.200" end="00:14.700" ttm:agent="v1">攬佬</p>
      <p begin="00:14.560" end="00:17.630" ttm:agent="v1">老天保佑金山銀山前路有</p>
      <p begin="00:17.630" end="00:21.260" ttm:agent="v1">老天教唆別管江湖龍虎鬥</p>
      <p begin="00:21.260" end="00:24.720" ttm:agent="v1">老天叮囑這輩子我善不丟</p>
      <p begin="00:24.720" end="00:28.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">老天就怕三十六雷總打秋 (yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:28.350" end="00:31.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">魑魅魍魎總出現在秋收後 (算賬)</p>
      <p begin="00:31.750" end="00:35.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">魑魅魍魎總出現在秋收後 (消滅)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.280" end="00:38.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">老天讓我一棍剷除齧齒類 (天數)</p>
      <p begin="00:38.470" end="00:41.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">第二棍附魔我打穿對家樓 (huh)</p>
      <p begin="00:41.560" end="00:44.170" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="00:44.170" end="00:45.860" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="00:45.860" end="00:48.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(老天讓放下屠刀但這是他的 ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:48.320" end="00:50.810" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="00:50.810" end="00:52.650" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="00:52.650" end="00:54.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(該不該放下屠刀? Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.440" end="00:55.940" ttm:agent="v1">如果放</p>
      <p begin="00:55.280" end="00:57.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">角落潛伏餓鬼分分鐘一棒 (打)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.750" end="00:59.250" ttm:agent="v1">如果提</p>
      <p begin="00:58.690" end="01:01.220" ttm:agent="v1">心中惡念超過善的話沒辦法平</p>
      <p begin="01:01.220" end="01:02.720" ttm:agent="v1">要還債</p>
      <p begin="01:02.180" end="01:04.630" ttm:agent="v1">兵來將擋因為我是個奈非天</p>
      <p begin="01:04.630" end="01:06.130" ttm:agent="v1">手腕上</p>
      <p begin="01:05.480" end="01:08.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">五路財神虛空藏 擋一切 (ha)</p>
      <p begin="01:08.150" end="01:09.650" ttm:agent="v1">海面刮大浪</p>
      <p begin="01:09.330" end="01:10.830" ttm:agent="v1">要不要秋後算賬?</p>
      <p begin="01:10.770" end="01:12.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">我不是God (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.570" end="01:13.070" ttm:agent="v1">我需要平衡陰陽</p>
      <p begin="01:12.760" end="01:15.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">看懂這因果業障 (看懂這因果業障) (攬佬)</p>
      <p begin="01:15.560" end="01:17.060" ttm:agent="v1">世界上條條框框</p>
      <p begin="01:16.570" end="01:18.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">就好像打牌記賬 (對)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.860" end="01:19.360" ttm:agent="v1">遲早會到你頭上</p>
      <p begin="01:19.060" end="01:21.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">誰不想打翻身仗 (誰不想打翻身仗 ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.620" end="01:23.590" ttm:agent="v1">總有人在賣著慘</p>
      <p begin="01:23.590" end="01:25.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(總有人想利用善)</p>
      <p begin="01:25.130" end="01:26.950" ttm:agent="v1">殊不知 天在看</p>
      <p begin="01:26.950" end="01:28.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">禍根找上門 (慘 ha)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.440" end="01:30.280" ttm:agent="v1">你把愛拿來鬧著玩</p>
      <p begin="01:30.280" end="01:32.030" ttm:agent="v1">你把愛當做子彈</p>
      <p begin="01:32.030" end="01:33.820" ttm:agent="v1">殊不知 天在看</p>
      <p begin="01:33.820" end="01:36.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">拍拍手 完蛋 (攬佬)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.540" end="01:40.100" ttm:agent="v1">老天保佑金山銀山前路有</p>
      <p begin="01:40.100" end="01:43.780" ttm:agent="v1">老天教唆別管江湖龍虎鬥</p>
      <p begin="01:43.780" end="01:47.170" ttm:agent="v1">老天叮囑這輩子我善不丟</p>
      <p begin="01:47.170" end="01:50.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">老天就怕三十六雷總打秋 (yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:50.420" end="01:53.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">魑魅魍魎總出現在秋收後 (算賬)</p>
      <p begin="01:53.830" end="01:57.420" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">魑魅魍魎總出現在秋收後 (消滅)</p>
      <p begin="01:57.420" end="02:00.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">老天讓我一棍剷除齧齒類 (天數)</p>
      <p begin="02:00.810" end="02:03.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">第二棍附魔我打穿對家樓 (huh)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.890" end="02:06.310" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="02:06.310" end="02:07.930" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="02:07.930" end="02:10.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(老天讓放下屠刀但這是他的 ayy)</p>
      <p begin="02:10.670" end="02:13.050" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="02:13.050" end="02:14.720" ttm:agent="v1">因果</p>
      <p begin="02:14.720" end="02:16.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(算了 給你個面子)</p>
